# Veda — AI-Powered PDF to Interactive Presentation Web App
# Cursor Rules File

## What This Project Is
Veda converts any uploaded PDF into an interactive narrated presentation with
karaoke-style word highlighting. The user uploads a PDF, the backend extracts
layout per page, **Qwen 2.5 7B on Kaggle GPU** (or **3B on laptop CPU fallback**)
generates slide JSON (title, subtitle, summary, highlights, narration), and
Sarvam AI handles TTS + STT for word-level timestamps. The mascot is Zoro —
a cartoon elephant avatar (New_Zoro.png) to be animated via HeyGen Talking Photo API.

---

